WEBVTT

00:00:05.241 --> 00:00:11.037
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:11.287 --> 00:00:15.883
Click Edit Staying Safe Online.

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:19.984
Click Publish.

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:24.085
Click Schedule.

00:00:24.335 --> 00:00:29.333
Type "03/12/2026" in the Date box.

00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:34.447
Click Schedule for 12 Mar, 9:00.

00:00:34.697 --> 00:00:40.697
Wait until you see is scheduled.
